WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.520
Birthdays. Weddings. Baby showers.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.710
And everyone asks the same thing… so what do you actually want?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.680
Meet GiftMe.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.590
Paste a link from any shop, or just search for what you’d love.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.560
Share one link with everyone.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.120
Friends chip in any amount, or reserve a gift to buy it themselves.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.210
The money lands straight in your bank,

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.059
and you say thank you in one tap.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.379
And find your people on GiftMe, so you never miss their big day.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.650
GiftMe. Wishlists your friends can actually give to.

